+### bb.experimental_p6rRoutes — canonical browser paths
+
+`bb.experimental_p6rRoutes.p6rThreadPath({ projectId, threadId })` returns BB's
+canonical browser path for a thread. Do not construct thread routes in plugin
+code: the personal project is intentionally projectless and resolves to
+`/threads/:threadId`, while ordinary projects resolve to
+`/projects/:projectId/threads/:threadId`.
+
 ### bb.log
 
 `bb.log.debug|info|warn|error(message: string)` — goes to the server log
